GIVEN `the writ is a writ of inquisition of life or limbs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Bar
DECIDE `ch 36 -- something may be given or taken for the writ` IS
    IF `the writ is a writ of inquisition of life or limbs`
    THEN Barred
    -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text does not speak to a case outside the facts this rule names.
